            "review_text": "John P\nHanoi, Vietnam122 contributions\n0\nMisrepresentation\nSep 2015 • Solo\nI ordered through www.vietnammm.com....their page says \"Buy 1 get 1 daily\"...a little nebulous but I interpreted that to mean buy 1, get 1 free. and I put a special note on the order for the driver to bring change for a larger denomination bill. So the pizza arrives (1) late (2) the driver doesn't have change (3 I get 1 only pizza. The driver calls the office and they say I will get a random gift from them - whatever the heck that means and NOT a free pizza. No date of \"gift\" to be received.\n\nAnd, the pizza was terrible taste. \n\nSo do yourself a favor...avoid this restaurant. I will.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 25, 2015",
