            "review_text": "AaronTrump\nHanoi, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nVietnamese Pizza style\nAug 2014 • Solo\nThe place have a good location. Just beside the famous Literature Temple, the first National University of Hanoi, found in 1070 :(\nThe service was quick. The pizza was ok. There are sit down area, which the decoration was just like the teen coffee in Hanoi with wall painting. Relaxing with air-con though.\nThey have the buy one get one pizza promotion daily. The price is cheap. But the staff spoke very limited English:( Any way, the menu is easy for you to choose the promotion.\nThe brand is famous among the young locals. It's ok if you want something international in the local way.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 22, 2014",
